  "rationale": "This Unicode bidirectional formatting control carries text-layout or directional metadata rather than a Persian Braille cell. The stable implementation leaves it unmapped and the draft implementation explicitly removes it from Braille output. The project adopts non-emitting format-control behavior rather than inventing a Braille mapping."
